      <title type="html">&lt;strong&gt;Released:&lt;/strong&gt; Rx.NET v7.0</title>
      <excerpt type="text">Rx.NET 7.0 ships, and the UI package split can cut 95MB from a self-contained deployment.</excerpt>
      <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rx.NET 7.0&lt;/strong&gt; moves UI framework support out of System.Reactive into separate packages, so a Windows target no longer implicitly pulls in WPF and WinForms.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
